{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>And you shall bequeath them to your children</b> — the second is a legal ruling (the noun <i>yerushah</i> applies), and the other instance is <b>והתנחלתם את הארץ</b> (and you shall take possession of the land). This is what the Sages said: a slave is linked to real property — to acquire by money, by deed, and by possession."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:37.136798993Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}